<title>FRANCE: French production bottlenecks rising - survey.</title>
<headline>French production bottlenecks rising - survey.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French production bottlenecks in manufacturing industry have risen further and are above their long-term average, national statistics institute INSEE said in its quarterly survey of business leaders.</p>
<p>It gave the following percentages of companies reporting production bottlenecks:</p>
<p>				1997	     1996		 1995</p>
<p>			    Jul  Apr   Jan  Oct Jul Apr   Jan Oct</p>
<p> Industry overall	19   16    11  16  14  15    13  19</p>
<p> Manufacturing	   22   18    10  12  12  11    13  17</p>
<p>It gave the following data on capacity utilisation rates (in percentages):</p>
<p>				  1997		    1996	    1995</p>
<p>			    Jul  Apr   Jan   Oct  Jul  Apr   Jan   Oct</p>
<p> Industry overall     83.5 83.6  81.4  82.3 82.7 83.8  83.6 84.2</p>
<p> Manufacturing	  83.2 83.2  82.7  82.1 82.4 83.6  83.5 84.2</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
